              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "tapfer — \"brave\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Das Kind war beim Arzt sehr tapfer. The child was very brave at the doctor's."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "The noun: die Tapferkeit — bravery."
            }
          ]
